	order_index: 4
	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>模组们携手相连！</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>本整合包包含大量科技模组，每种矿石产量翻倍，以及五个各有独立系统的魔法模组。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"两种痛苦：一种是模组给你半成品，其他模组无法继续加工，导致它永远躺在箱子里。另一种是两个模组让你重复刷同一个东西，因为它们都看不到对方已经给你的物品。"
				""
				"本章所有内容都会教你如何搭建桥梁！"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两条规则</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"[!info] 桥梁需要两个模组都取得进展。如果一个配方给了你血魔法物品，它也会要求你提供一个。"
				""
				"[!warn] 桥梁绝非最佳路线。将半加工物品投入更高级别，所得总少于直接投入原材料。你为捷径付出代价，而这正是设计意图。"
				""
				"[!success] 你真正得到的是延伸能力。一种用过剩的资源去换取那些总是短缺的东西的方法。"
			]
			icon: "create:brass_hand"
			id: "45A90626119216E7"
			shape: "gear"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1DF5FBD536486E2D"
				title: "把桥梁都给我看一遍"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6>桥梁</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.0d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>梯子</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>创造、沉浸式工程、热力膨胀和机械动力都会处理你的矿石。这看起来像是四个模组在为一项工作争吵。但它们并没有。它们就像阶梯一样，站在你上面的每一级都比你现在站的要更好。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这些是直接从配方文件中读取的真实数据。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>原矿锭数比</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>熔炉，或是压轮再冶炼 </grad><grad from=#8A8A8A to=#6E6E6E f=0.8>1.00倍</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal Pulverizer </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>1.25x</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>沉浸式工程破碎机 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>1.33x</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism Enrichment Chamber </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>1.33x</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism 净化室 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>2.00x</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism Chemical Injection Chamber </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>2.67x</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism 化学溶解室 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>3.33x</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>为何创造是最后的选择</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Crushing Wheels 不需要电网、多区块结构或化学配方。第三天你就能用风车驱动它。这种便利的代价是产量，但这笔交易向来公平。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>矿石 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>方块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>讲述着同样的故事。创造模式给1.75，Thermal和IE给2，Mekanism的四个等级分别给2、3、4和5。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!note] 这里没有任何内容被重新平衡。模组作者们本来就是这么设计的。只是从未被记录下来，所以看起来像是四台机器在做同一件事。"
			]
			icon: "create:crushing_wheel"
			id: "3EB382E015090BF6"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0CA4FD387494AC28"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6>矿石阶梯</grad></shadow>"
			x: -5.5d
			y: -4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>死胡同</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>粉碎轮将原矿变成粉碎原铁及其同类。它们有且仅有两种未来：熔炼成一个锭，或洗出九个碎片。两者产出均为 </grad><grad from=#8A8A8A to=#6E6E6E f=0.8>1.00x</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所以，当你超越了Create的那一天，基地里每个装有碎矿石的箱子，其价值都悄悄低于投入的原始矿石。那真是本整合包最糟糕的死胡同了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它将去往何方</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>沉浸式工程破碎机消耗一个矿石，产出一种粉尘，并有 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>12.5%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的几率获得第二种粉尘。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>机械动力净化室消耗两种矿石碎块和氧气，产出</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>三团</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>产物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>仍然不是捷径</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>算一算。一个原矿块通过 Crushing Wheels 能得到 1.75 个 crushed，再变成 2.63 个 clumps，而 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>3.00</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个则是你一开始就把原矿块扔进 Purification Chamber 能得到的数量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>粉碎者讲述着同样的故事：绕远路要1.97个尘埃，而直接走只需</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>2.00</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。走Create路线总会亏，只是不再亏掉</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>一切</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 你的旧货堆又有价值了，而且你已经建好的创造模式矿石农场在你升级技术的同时还在持续产出。"
				""
				"[!danger] 这里没有循环。包里没有任何东西能将锭、粉尘或块状物变回原矿石，所以无法无限循环。"
			]
			icon: "create:crushed_raw_iron"
			id: "30BDF8AFF1F214C7"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: false
				id: "7246281B0F386C94"
				item: "create:crushed_raw_iron"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6>物尽其用，毫无浪费</grad></shadow>"
			x: -6.0d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>人工培育</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Certus 和 Fluix 是通过将带电晶体和尘埃投入水池中等待来生长的。这很有效，符合模组设定，但自动化起来非常痛苦。你需要物品掉落、一片水域，以及某种方法来将产物打捞出来。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生长加速器能加快方块发芽，但不是这个。当基地其他地方都铺满管道和驱动器后，晶体复制机仍然让你站在一片水洼里。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>进入机器世界</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism Combiner 现在将这两个世界转换都作为普通配方运行。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>带电的 certus 加 certus 粉尘会生成 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>两个 certus 晶体</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>带电的 certus 加 fluix 粉尘可生成 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>一个 fluix 晶体</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"与水的版本完全相同。不多一个晶体。你买的是自动化，不是产量，为此你要付出组合器和运行它的代价。"
				""
				"[!info] 充电仍需AE2充电器，因此没有步骤能脱离链条。管道只是替代了你过去手动完成的步骤。"
			]
			icon: "ae2:fluix_crystal"
			id: "6DE3A2C6E9B46DFB"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "56232CA6F4C1998B"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6>定时出现的晶体</grad></shadow>"
			x: -6.0d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两颗铀矿</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Powah 会生成铀矿石。Immersive Engineering 和 Mekanism 会生成铀矿石。同一种元素，但它们从未互相交谈过。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Powah 早就知道这一点。它的 Energizing Orb 能将铀锭转化为铀矿，消耗 30,000 FE。回程的道路并不存在，所以如果你的世界给了你铀矿脉，你只会得到一堆反应堆燃料，却没有办法制造哪怕一块铀板。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>修复程序</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>沉浸式工程破碎机现已支持两种Powah铀矿形式。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>铀矿会掉落 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>一份铀粉</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>原始铀矿会掉落 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>一份粉尘，并有33%的几率掉落第二份</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>往返循环本身毫无意义。一个铀锭需要消耗30,000 FE才能变成铀矿，而最终只会返还一单位粉尘，也就是一个锭。你消耗了能量却一无所获，所以不存在值得运行的循环。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 你获得的很简单。铀矿脉现在是铀的来源，而铀矿脉本来就是铀矿的来源。无论你的世界生成的是哪种，两种模组都能正常运行。"
			]
			icon: "powah:uraninite"
			id: "3DCCE64519737CF5"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: false
				id: "1310FAEBD19B6972"
				item: "powah:uraninite"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6>两种铀矿石</grad></shadow>"
			x: -6.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>八个孤儿</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>铁、铜、金、铅、锡、锇和铀的产量是它们矿石的</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>五倍之多。而本整合包中另外八种矿石则完全没有任何加工配方，无论是在Create、Thermal、Immersive Engineering还是Mekanism中都没有。你只能挖矿，然后永远地一个一个地熔炼它们。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>没人猜中那份清单。包里的每种矿石和原材料标签都对照了全部463个模组里的每个配方。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>现已加入爬梯系统</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Undergarden: </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Cloggrum, Froststeel, Utherium, Regalium</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>铁的魔导书： </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>秘银</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Ad Astra: </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Desh, Ostrum, Calorite</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"Crushing Wheels 给 1.75 倍，Crusher 和 Pulverizer 给 2 倍。和那些机器给铁的量完全一样。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>为什么他们停在2倍速上</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism的3x、4x和5x等级需要团块、碎片和晶体，而这些物品仅适用于Mekanism自带的金属。没有公平的方法能用外来金属达到这些等级，除非发明新物品，所以这八种金属最高只能到2x。这是一个真正的上限，并非被遗忘的设定。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!note] Ad Astra 已有 Crushing Wheels 支持，仅新增其余两种。其深板岩矿石在 Create 中仍能最佳粉碎，与原版铁矿相同。"
			]
			icon: "undergarden:cloggrum_ingot"
			id: "03B613DD9747EF55"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "21CB7B317C6FD8E9"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6>被遗忘的阶梯金属</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>单一材质</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Industrial Foregoing 用从树上采集的乳胶制作塑料。Mekanism 用基板和氧气制作 HDPE 板。Immersive Engineering 用酚醛树脂压制 Duroplast 板。三个模组，一种材料，却没有一个能识别到其他模组的存在。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>共享的塑料标签里只有Industrial Foregoing的物品，而</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>62</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>个Industrial Foregoing配方读取了该标签。所以无论你的Mekanism生产线产出了多少HDPE，IF仍然会叫你种一棵树农场。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>修复程序</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism HDPE Sheets 和 IE Duroplast Plates 已被加入塑料标签。这 62 个配方现在都会使用你实际制作的塑料。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>单向通行</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>反向通道是故意关闭的。如果塑料是三者中最便宜的，因为乳胶比Mekanism氧气或IE酚醛树脂早得多。用它代替另外两种会跳过真正的进度。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 后期材料出现在前期配方中是允许的。反之则是越级，所以会被关闭。"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:hdpe_sheet"
			id: "7C1BA4F2C5BA81FC"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7EA93E4F8AAA6624"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6>三种塑料</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>Souls By Hand</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>灵魂吸收器将物品转化为</grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>灵魂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，可用于支付所有壁炉配方和召唤所需的费用。它的输入物全是 sculk、灵魂沙、ectoplasm 和图腾。这些都是你</grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>找到</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的，而不是你</grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>生产</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>与此同时，你几乎肯定拥有一个装有 Mob Grinding Utils 锯子的刷怪塔，或者一个全天候运行的 Hostile Neural Networks 模拟程序。Goety 拒绝看两者中的任何一个。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>当下何物重要</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>固化的经验值价值 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>2 灵魂</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>实心经验方块价值 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>20 灵魂</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>敌对神经网络预测价值为 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>15 灵魂</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>作为参考，灵魂沙价值25，不死图腾价值200。实心经验块的价值为20，低于灵魂沙，但与灵魂沙不同，它会再生。这正是它存在的意义所在。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>预测的价格是故意定得比其他工作低。十五个灵魂可是真金白银，所以你在这里烧毁的每一份预测，都意味着它从未到达过战利品制造机。你是在二选一，而不是在创造第三项选择。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 这些都不是免费的。三者都要求先建一个能用的农场，这比 Goety 单独提出的任何要求都要大得多。"
			]
			icon: "goety:soul_absorber"
			id: "65555B9C320A7474"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0009BDEBF25D98B8"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>喂养死者的机器</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两个农场</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Biomancy 依靠 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>Nutrients</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>运行，这些 Nutrients 由食物在 Digester 中生成。早期这意味着要建造第二个农场，其唯一用途是为将作物转化为浆糊的机器提供食物。你的第一个农场已经做到了这一点。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>楼上，Industrial Foregoing 正在把污水提炼成粉红史莱姆，却不知道如何处理多余的产物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>修复程序</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>消化器：一个粉红史莱姆可产出 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>四份营养膏</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>分解者：一个粉红史莱姆锭可产出 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>2至4个弹性纤维</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，偶尔还有有机物</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个史莱姆产四块膏体，效率是原版作物的两倍，理所应当。输入端是 Mob Slaughter Factory、Sewage Composter 和 Sludge Refiner 的远端。三台机器前你就已经为此付费了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>分解者的配方比看上去更重要。弹性纤维是大多数生物魔法中后期装备的入口，通常由怪物掉落逐个获得。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 营养物质无法再变成粉红史莱姆，因此此过程为单向的。"
			]
			icon: "industrialforegoing:pink_slime_ingot"
			id: "4CBB561DD5E3F173"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: false
				id: "4D023EB3550B49CE"
				item: "industrialforegoing:pink_slime"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>史莱姆转化为养分</grad></shadow>"
			x: -2.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>手种农场</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>《Ars Nouveau》里的每件长袍、每根线、半数实用方块都需要 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>法师花纤维</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。每朵花产四根纤维，每株成熟植物一朵花，且植物只在户外生长。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>没有自动化的机器可以种植它。你得拿着锄头在田里走。对于一个以自动化哥olem为特色的模组来说，这要求真奇怪。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>修复程序</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal Phytogenic Insolator 现在接受 Magebloom 作物作为种子，并返还给你 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>两个 Magebloom</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 以及种子本身。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用手收割成熟的植物会获得一朵花和大约1.57个种子，而多余的种子正是田地生长的方式。Insolator会给出</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>双倍的花朵</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，但只返还一个种子，所以你的田地永远不会自行扩张。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这就是交易。Insolator 适用于你已建好的农场。电力和水力均为 Thermal 基准值的 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>2倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] Magebloom作物仍只能通过Enchanting Apparatus和四个Source Gem获得，Ars的进度没有任何变化。Thermal模组只生长Ars已经播种的植物。"
			]
			icon: "ars_nouveau:magebloom_fiber"
			id: "39C55C83E4356AD0"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: false
				id: "5EAB6F8AAE4918F9"
				item: "ars_nouveau:magebloom"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>玻璃下的法师之花</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>相反的问题</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>血魔法真正的瓶颈不是生命精华，而是</grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>吞吐量</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。一阶祭坛每秒消耗5点生命，无论储备多少，将空白石板变为加固石板的过程，就是长时间凝视着一根血柱的过程。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Goety 的形状正好相反。一旦壁炉点燃，灵魂会迅速堆积，而能消耗它们的物品却很少。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>交易内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在炼金术灵魂熔炉处：</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>空白石板、暗影精华、灵魂沙和 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>150个灵魂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会给予一个加固石板</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>强化板岩、暗影精华、诅咒锭和 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>400灵魂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会获得一块附魔板岩</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在血液魔法灵魂熔炉中：</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两个铁、一个金、一个暗影精华和10个恶魔意志将给出 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>四个诅咒锭</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两个方向都需要另一个模组的物品。没有现有的石板就无法制作石板，没有暗影精华和灵魂熔炉就无法批量生产诅咒锭。两个模组的入口都没有移动。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>石板的比例保持一比一。熔炉的效率不比祭坛高，只是更</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>快</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而且还要消耗灵魂作为代价。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 两款死亡魔法模组终于共享一个工坊。花掉你囤积过多的任意货币吧。"
			]
			icon: "bloodmagic:reinforcedslate"
			id: "6C2ED49148A19420"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "59BF6301B8EFBAB1"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>Souls For Slates</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两种能量</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>自然的气息会将其周围的灵气吸入自身。新艺术风格将灵气储存在瓶中。两者都是环境魔法，都能自行补充，且彼此无法消耗对方的灵气。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>交易内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>自然祭坛与转化催化剂：一个源宝石和 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>60,000 点气场</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 可提供一个大地精华</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>灌注室：一个铁锭，基座上放置着大地精华和金粉，以及 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>2,500 源能</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，可获得两个灌注铁锭</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两种配方都需要远端模组的组件，所以都无法作为入口。祭坛配方仍需源宝石，而灌注配方仍需金粉。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Infused Iron 通常每个需要 15,000 Aura。而 Ars 路线则需要 2,500 Source 和每两个一个 Earth Essence。用 Aura 更便宜，但更费工夫，而且还需要一个你可能还没建造的 Imbuement Chamber。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>黄金陷阱</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"[!danger] 所有涉及金叶的配方都刻意避开了。金叶会在这个祭坛上粉碎成四份金粉，所以用粉末合成叶子会导致无限循环。金粉放进去就再也出不来了。"
			]
			icon: "naturesaura:infused_iron"
			id: "0602C32806936BA6"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5989AA4D518FB71A"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>光环与源头</grad></shadow>"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>毫无用处的草药</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Hexerei 会种植五种草药，在架子上晾干，却几乎没什么东西可以消耗它们。它是整合包里最孤独的模组，一整套种植链只为了一份很短的配方列表服务。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>与此同时，新艺术风格将大部分好装备锁在</grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>精粹</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>背后，每件在灌注室都需要一个源宝石、三种试剂和2000源点。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>修复程序</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在装满水的加热搅拌锅中：</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所有五种干草、一个 Magebloom 和两颗 Source Gem 可换取 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>两颗 Conjuration Essence</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>换算下来，每份需要一颗源宝石、半朵魔花、两朵半干草和 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>零个源宝石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。你是在用农活支付魔法能量，这正是女巫所做的。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>源宝石限制了Ars，干草药限制了Hexerei，因为你需要柳树农场、晾晒架和加热锅才能生产出第一份精华。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 召唤精华是主题之选。如果想让另外六个也用同样的方式连接，只需修改一个文件即可。"
			]
			icon: "hexerei:mixing_cauldron"
			id: "419550A50D29C340"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "73F8B429F664B20D"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>女巫的蒸馏术</grad></shadow>"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>相反的形状</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Ars Nouveau 和 Blood Magic 是这里最大的两个魔法模组，但它们之间完全没有共同语言。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它们也以相反的方式失败。血魔法受制于</grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>吞吐量</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，无论储存多少，都以固定速率消耗。新艺术受制于</grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>消耗速度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，因为无论你是否使用，罐子都会不断填充。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>交易内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>附魔装置：线、两颗源宝石和一块空白石板，需要 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>1,000 源能量</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，可产出四个灵魂捕手</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>炼金术台：一张空白画布、两颗紫晶和红石，需要 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>2,000 LP</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 可获得两颗源宝石</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>灵魂捕网是纯粹的消耗品。你燃烧它们来捕获恶魔意志，每个通常消耗祭坛500LP。用储存的源购买四个，可以免去祭坛的消耗，并不会让意志变得更便宜。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>源宝石的交易是两者中故意设计得</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>较差的</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。灌注室用500源石和零片板就能换取同等价值的紫水晶。只有在源石短缺且LP充裕时，你才会选择此项交易。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 两种配方都需要空白石板，所以都无法直接用于血魔法。你需要先运行祭坛，这两种配方才会出现。"
			]
			icon: "bloodmagic:soulsnare"
			id: "75050E9E512E1F09"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "48E19AF32E1CB2ED"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>陷阱与源头</grad></shadow>"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两者皆由死亡制成</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生物魔法催生血肉，炼金术收割灵魂。两者整局游戏都在摆弄死物，却毫无共同之处。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>交易内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>灵魂吸收器：肉块价值 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>2 个灵魂</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>分解者：Goety Ectoplasm会分解成</grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>1至3个生物发光体</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，偶尔还有有机物</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>血肉碎片是生物魔法最常见的副产品，价格相应地低于五分之一份的 ectoplasm。这里没有任何有价值的东西值得燃烧来换取灵魂。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Living Flesh 是故意被排除的。用 Primordial Cradle 的产品交换灵魂是一笔没人会做的亏本买卖，而没人用的配方在书里也只是占地方而已。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 分解者本身具有天然的安全性。分解者只会分解物品，因此无法跳过闸门。"
			]
			icon: "biomancy:flesh_bits"
			id: "0DDBC23BEB4CB2D9"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2829CA3AA6E2C059"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>血肉与幽魂物质</grad></shadow>"
			x: -5.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>恒定消耗</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>秘术灰烬绘制了血魔法运行的炼金术阵列。它们每次都会被消耗，每批需要消耗500LP和四种试剂，在炼金术台上与其他一切事务竞争。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>修复程序</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>自然祭坛与转化催化剂：火药和 </grad><grad from=#C08CFF to=#8A5BFF f=0.8>20,000 点气场</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 可获取奥术灰烬</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>光环会自行恢复，且无法通过其他方式消耗在血魔法上，因此这能将闲置资源转化为可保留的祭坛时间。火药成本不变，转化催化剂意味着自然光环会优先获得实际进度。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 黄金和之前一样，不能参与这个配方。金叶子在这个祭坛上会压成四个金粉，所以任何接触这对物品的东西都有可能导致无限循环。"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "bloodmagic:arcaneashes"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
			id: "44355A05E937198A"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "69231E05D5BC59E6"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>来自空气的灰烬</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>新的瓶颈</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>女巫的蒸馏术能将五种干草变成新艺术精华。听起来很划算，直到你发现这五种草都得一棵一棵地手工采摘。解决了一个瓶颈，却悄悄制造了另一个。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[gap=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>修复程序</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal Phytogenic Insolator 现已能生长所有五种 Hexerei 草药，返还你 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>双倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>作物和恰好一株植物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>鼠尾草、曼德拉草、颠茄、艾草和龙牙草</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>平衡</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和本章早些时候的 Magebloom 一样。产量翻倍，但植物只会再生一次，所以你的花园永远不会自动生长。电力和水的需求是 Thermal 基准的 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>1.5倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，比 Magebloom 便宜，因为草药的价值较低。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 结合蒸馏和这个，Hexerei 草药园现在可以为 Ars Nouveau 提供源源不断的精华，整个流程无需手动种植。"
			]
			icon: "hexerei:mandrake_root"
			id: "5CEDD0A2C9540BB7"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "210D626B931869AC"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>草药园</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.5d
			y: -4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>缺失的标签</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>标签是模组识别另一个模组物品的方式。当标签缺失时，两个相同的物品会像互不相关的材料一样，直到某个配方突然失败你才会发现。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Almost Unified 已经处理了锭、粉尘、宝石和矿石。但这四种被排除在材料列表之外，确实存在漏洞。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[gap=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>新增内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal Coal Coke，加入共享的煤炭焦油标签中</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal Block of Coal Coke，加入通用方块标签中</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal Sawdust，加入通用木屑标签中</grad></shadow>"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal Slag，加入通用 slag 标签中</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>可解锁内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal的Pyrolyzer产出的焦炭现在可以为Immersive Engineering的Blast Furnace提供燃料，喂养Crusher生成焦炭粉，并压缩成焦炭块。在此之前，Thermal的玩家必须建造第二个完全多余的Coke Oven才能炼钢。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>三种锯木厂中的任意一种产生的锯末，现在在所有需要锯末的配方中均可使用，而不再局限于制作该锯末的模组配方。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!note] 这些只会添加条目。没有从任何标签中移除内容，所以之前能用的东西都不会坏掉。"
			]
			icon: "thermal:coal_coke"
			id: "4CE6A30A9E676588"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4AA2263E1A36FAB1"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6>统一标签</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>毫无用处的尘埃</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal's Pulverizer 能将铁锭变成铁粉。它的 Centrifuge 能将因瓦粉分解回铁和镍。粉碎铜矿石，甚至还能顺便得到一点金粉。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这些粉尘没有一个能被冶炼。无论是 Thermal 还是任何人，都无法做到。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>事件原因</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal 没有提供粉尘到锭的配方。它依赖 Mekanism 提供的配方，而该配方读取了一个共享标签。但 Thermal 只对其 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>自身</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的青铜、因瓦和电金系列合金的粉尘添加了标签。它的铁、铜、金、钻石、绿宝石、青金石、下界合金、石英、硫磺和末影珍珠粉尘则完全 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>没有标签</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，所以该配方从未识别到它们。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>还有六种更惨。Signalum、Lumium、Enderium、Apatite、Cinnabar和Niter dust都属于那些</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>没有任何模组声明的标签，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这悄悄关闭了Thermal的熔炉和结晶器配方，以及Evolved Mekanism针对这三种合金的整个熔化链。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>修复程序</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所有 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>28</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal dusts 现已归入正确的标签。它们可以被熔炼、合金化、用于结晶器，Almost Unified 也终于能看到它们了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 没有重新平衡。所有这些往返行程在设计之初就已经收支平衡。Invar 投入 2 铁和 1 镍，产出也是 2 铁和 1 镍。这只会让原本就设计好的配方变得可达成。"
				""
				"[!note] Thermal的齿轮、板和铜粒都有相同的孔并被标记，还有Terramity的红宝石和蓝宝石。"
			]
			icon: "thermal:iron_dust"
			id: "4A36335004FEB343"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5CC8D5604EFA8D24"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6>无处可去的尘埃</grad></shadow>"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4CE6A30A9E676588"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>空桶</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal's Refinery将原油裂解为重油和轻油，再将两者蒸馏成精炼燃料。Ad Astra's Fuel Refinery则将自身的石油转化为火箭所需的燃料。两个模组，两种石油，而共享的原油标签却完全空着。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>空得连Thermal's Refinery都无法接收原油，</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Thermal本身也无法产出，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>整个石化生产线都加载正常，地球上没有任何东西能接触到它。></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>石油的由来</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>热力学离心机，每份油砂产出 100 mB 油砂油</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Ad Astra 油井，聚集在钻井架下方</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>开启内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"两种油现在都供应给两家炼油厂。一百份原油分成四十份重油和六十份轻油，最终产出九十份精炼燃料，并附带沥青、焦油和硫磺。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用同样的桶在Ad Astra中操作，就能得到火箭燃料，一换一。你的采石场现在为发射台提供燃料了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 热力路线是损耗较大的。你需要放弃十分之一的体积，才能得到发电机真正想要的燃料。"
				""
				"[!warn] 油砂和油井都是世界生成物。没有任何东西会制造它们，所以任何方向都无法产出燃料。"
			]
			icon: "thermal:crude_oil_bucket"
			id: "4C8DE7F0F4BF4604"
			shape: "pentagon"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1C56B16C355CDD29"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6>油...自由</grad></shadow>"
			x: -5.0d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4CE6A30A9E676588"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两座高炉</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Pyrolyzer 同时给你煤炭、焦炭和焦油。Immersive Engineering 需要焦油来制作处理木材、火把和燃料，它通过共享标签来寻找焦油。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermal's creosote 从来不在那个标签里。所以你很可能正坐在 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>成吨的这东西上，却被告知要先造 Coke Oven，才能造木板。</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>重新开启的内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>经手工或 Spout 处理的木材</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>火把</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>沉浸式工程发电机，作为燃料</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>通往酚醛树脂的炼油厂</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>创建Addition的液体燃烧器</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!note] 与所有标签修复一样，是累加的。Immersive Engineering 的 creosote 在所有原有位置仍然有效。"
			]
			icon: "thermal:creosote_bucket"
			id: "5528F62230CF9EED"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7E6FEB4A65154372"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6>Creosote Counts Twice</grad></shadow>"
			x: -3.0d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["419550A50D29C340"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>全套装备</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>炼药罐最初只知道一种配方：召唤术，别无他物。其余六个学派现在都以完全相同的方式酿造：五种干草、一朵法师花和两颗源宝石，产出两份精华。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每所学校的花费都相同。不同的是，</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>所用的草药种类，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每种配方都侧重于适合其气质的草药。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B48CFF to=#DCC4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>一价七调</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>禁咒术依赖智者的力量</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>艾草上的空气</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>黄色船坞上的泥土</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将火引向曼陀罗草</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>对曼德拉草的操控</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>水将鼠尾草和欧洲商陆均匀分开</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>召唤术各取其一，一如既往</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 还是没有一滴源。灌注室要2000才能换一滴精粹；而炼药锅却要一个花园。"
				""
				"[!warn] 锅中要有水，底下要有火焰。如果又冷又干，草药只会静静地待在那里。"
			]
			icon: "ars_nouveau:fire_essence"
			id: "6EFECFA0414316EF"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2C93750030669152"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C08CFF to=#F0D9FF f=0.6>七种精华全部收集</grad></shadow>"
			x: 6.0d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3EB382E015090BF6"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>绝不遗漏任何矿石</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>本整合包中有22种材料是直接从地里挖出来的。21种材料与机器的组合</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>完全没有配方</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。你把矿石放进去，机器就只是静静地待在那里。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>破碎之物</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>铝、镍、银、锌和秘银： </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Mekanism 中没有任何东西</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>磷灰石、朱砂和硫磺：没有破碎机，没有富集器</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>红宝石和蓝宝石：四台机器中缺失</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>萤石：压轮不会接触到它</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>全部修复。你挖到的任何东西都会进入你拥有的任何机器里。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两个错误的家伙</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两种创造配方产出的材料，比亲自挖掘该方块得到的材料要少，现已修正。冶炼矿石不应导致材料损失。两项均已修正。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Terramity的红宝石和蓝宝石矿石块从未被标记为矿石。宝石是，存储块是，但真正的矿石块却不是。包里没有任何机器会接受这四种矿石块。现已修复。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 未移除任何内容，未涨价。所有之前可用的路线现在都完全一样。"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:ingot_osmium"
			id: "41D7C0B3E8993E1A"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "38A8B17617F3CF8A"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6>不遗留任何矿石</grad></shadow>"
			x: -7.0d
			y: -4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["41D7C0B3E8993E1A"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>Maximum Overore</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism 将矿石翻倍是通用的。超出部分则不然。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>三种、四种和五种形式的 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>团块、碎片、晶体和浆料</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每种都必须作为该金属的独立实体存在。Mekanism 只支持其自身的七种金属，不支持其他金属。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>那么</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>铁、金、铜、锡、铅、锇和铀都一路涨到了五。铝、镍、银、锌和秘银</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>却卡在二上不走了，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无论你把多少机器拼在一起，都毫无用处。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>现在</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>五种矿石都有全套。净化器成一团，破碎机成脏粉，注射器成碎片，溶解器成脏浆液，清洗器、结晶器成晶体。 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>每种矿石五个锭子，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和原版一样。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 泥浆是根据颜色而非纹理绘制的，所以没人需要绘制秘银泥浆。"
				""
				"[!note] 这个需要真正的代码，所以它出现在梯子的其他部分之后。"
			]
			icon: "linggango_tweaks:crystal_mithril"
			id: "2B82265116ABE650"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6683CAAD8DAAB934"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6>Maximum Overore</grad></shadow>"
			x: -8.5d
			y: -4.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["41D7C0B3E8993E1A"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>砾石淋浴</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>吹过水中的风扇会冲走杂物。以前回报很少，但现在回报丰厚，以至于</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>将鹅卵石生成机对准它都变得值得了</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[gap=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>四行诗</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>沙砾能产出燧石和铁粒。现在还能产出 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>锌粒和镍粒</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>沙子能烧制黏土。现在还能烧制 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>磷灰石</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>灵魂沙产出了石英和金。现在还有 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>硫磺</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>红沙带来了黄金和枯死的灌木。现在还带来了 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>红宝石</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个速率都已在该行某处被 Create 使用，所有旧回报也仍然存在。没有任何东西被交易掉。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>农场</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将鹅卵石生成器放入磨石中得到砾石。砾石在压路机下得到沙子。用风扇将水吹过两者。然后去做别的事吧。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>故意设计得很慢。重点在于它 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>永不停歇</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 红沙和灵魂沙不会再生。红宝石和硫磺的产量取决于你实际挖掘的数量，这是有意为之的。"
			]
			icon: "create:encased_fan"
			id: "41B61646AF437792"
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "175A5B380A05A1BB"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#B7E4FF f=0.6>砾石淋浴</grad></shadow>"
			x: -8.5d
			y: -3.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["45A90626119216E7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>触摸草地代替</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>本整合包中一些顶级的合成台都有一个问题：你必须站在旁边。现在其中三种有了能代你完成的机器。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[gap=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>老一套的把戏</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>取来真正的设备，</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>将其建造成结构体，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用该模组的方块将其围起来，再安装一个带有物品、能量和所需流体端口的控制器。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>该装置就是门。在没有自动化对象的情况下，无法建造这些装置，因此它们都不能跳过步骤。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>三人组</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Enchanting Forge\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#FFECBE\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1CB72C8D32F74AAA\" } }"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>新艺术风格的附魔装置及其基座环。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Sanguine Alembic\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#FFECBE\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4439BF4F7D1255F8\" } }"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>血液魔法的炼金术台，输入生命精华作为流体。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Tartaric Foundry\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#FFECBE\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"072AE50C44090407\" } }"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>地狱熔炉，用恶魔意志水晶支付。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>房屋规则</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个物品五千FE，全部三种</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>合成所需时间与手动合成完全相同，</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>绝不会更快</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>手持版本从未被移除，也从未被削弱过</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>能拿回晚上的时间就是最大的回报。它在夜间运行，在你挖矿时运行，而且不需要你点击任何东西。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!note] 这三种方块在 JEI 中都会显示配方和建造布局。查找控制器方块即可。"
			]
			icon: "linggango_tweaks:enchanting_forge"
			id: "30E05748442B5294"
			shape: "pentagon"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "&8[点击阅读]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6A1E1814C5EFC14C"
				title: "明白了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE f=0.6>触摸草地代替</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
	]
	title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF8C46 to=#FFECBE>桥梁</grad></shadow>"
}
